<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara's reserves rose to 71.12 bln ringgit.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara's reserves rose to 71.12 bln ringgit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves rose to 71.12 billion ringgit as at May 15 against 70.93 billion a fortnight earlier, the Bank said in a statement on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The central bank said its total assets and liabilities rose to 96.93 billion ringgit from 95.67 billion two weeks earlier.</p>
<p>(In bln ringgit)  May 15 1997     Apr 30 1997     May 15 1996</p>
<p>Reserves		 71.12	     70.93	     66.02</p>
<p>Assets		   96.93	     95.67	     94.13</p>
<p>Currency		 22.25	     22.17	     19.13</p>
<p>Govt paper		1.64		1.62		3.21</p>
</text>
